Source code
-----------

The complete source of the images, including every change made to code under
the APSL, the MPL, the CDDL and the LGPL, is at https://github.com/kido-sh/darwin.
The third-party sources that flake.lock and the recipes in
nix/darwin/third-party pin come from the upstream locations listed below.


